WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.000
Your cold call opener
needs to start

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:02.920
a conversation.

3
00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:04.690
Here is an example.

4
00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:05.910
Hi Sam,

5
00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:07.270
Alex at CallTeam.

6
00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:09.070
When there is a
company you would

7
00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:09.710
like to win,

8
00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:11.190
who makes the first
call?

9
00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:13.020
Then pause.

10
00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:15.340
The buyer says, Our
reps do.

11
00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:18.220
You ask, When they
are busy closing

12
00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:18.540
deals,

13
00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.620
do they still get
through that list?

14
00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:22.550
Now listen.

15
00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:24.590
If accounts are being
missed,

16
00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:26.150
ask which ones.

17
00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.110
If the team has it
covered,

18
00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:29.830
thank them and move
on.

19
00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:32.220
Practise the opening
until it sounds

20
00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:32.790
like you.

